# cage's own design names its ports: the command line, the configuration loader and the legend of codes.
# Everything else in src/ is how they are done, not what they promise. Tags in these files are still read.

# The executable: wires the ports to the process.
cli.ts

# The ports' files: their other exports are helpers of the port, not promises of their own.
main.ts
config.ts
codes.ts

